WEBVTT

00:03.578 --> 00:06.474
<i>[energetic music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

00:06.543 --> 00:10.647
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:12.854 --> 00:16.785
Oh!
This restaurant is so fancy.
哦！
这家餐厅太豪华了。

00:16.854 --> 00:19.130
Even the silverware's
made of velvet.
就连银器
由天鹅绒制成。

00:19.199 --> 00:21.026
Ooh.
哦。

00:21.095 --> 00:23.509
[giggles]
Nothing's too good
[咯咯笑]
没什么太好的

00:23.578 --> 00:25.543
for my Puffekins.
为了我的海雀。

00:25.612 --> 00:28.509
Madame and Monsieur, your menus.
女士和先生，你们的菜单。

00:28.578 --> 00:31.302
Thank you.
These prices!
谢谢。
这些价格！

00:31.371 --> 00:33.923
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

00:33.992 --> 00:36.578
And what would
Mademoiselle desire?
以及什么会
小姐的愿望？

00:36.647 --> 00:39.095
[giggles]
I don't know!
[咯咯笑]
我不知道！

00:39.164 --> 00:41.405
What do you think, Krabsy-wabsy?
你觉得怎么样，克拉布西-瓦布西？

00:41.474 --> 00:45.543
Uh, the water looks
delicious, puff-cake.
呃，水看起来
美味，酥饼。

00:45.612 --> 00:48.061
[laughs]
Such a kidder.
[笑]
真是个孩子。

00:48.130 --> 00:52.612
Monsieur and I will have
the Kelp Consommé to start.
先生和我将会
首先是海带清汤。

00:52.681 --> 00:54.509
[gulps]
To start?
[吞咽]
要开始吗？

00:54.578 --> 00:56.509
Followed by the Sargasso Salad.
接下来是马尾藻沙拉。

00:56.578 --> 00:59.716
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

00:59.785 --> 01:03.405
And the Sweet and Sour Algae.
还有糖醋藻类。

01:03.474 --> 01:07.509
Ah, may I suggest
the Coral Jubilee for dessert?
啊，我可以建议一下吗
珊瑚禧年甜点？

01:07.578 --> 01:10.164
It's our most expensive item.
这是我们最贵的东西。

01:10.233 --> 01:13.405
Oh, yes,
we must try that, Eugene.
哦，是的，
我们必须尝试一下，尤金。

01:13.474 --> 01:14.854
We'll take two.
我们要两个。

01:14.923 --> 01:17.543
[nervous laugh]
Yeah, sure.
[紧张的笑声]
是的，当然。

01:17.612 --> 01:19.164
Of course.
当然。

01:19.233 --> 01:22.199
Excellent choice, Mademoiselle.
很棒的选择，小姐。

01:22.268 --> 01:25.268
[whimpers]
Do something Krabs!
[呜咽]
蟹蟹们，做点什么吧！

01:25.337 --> 01:28.474
You're gonna go broke!
[gasping]
你会破产的！
[喘气]

01:28.543 --> 01:30.750
Ah!
[chuckles]
啊!
[笑声]

01:30.819 --> 01:33.543
I'll get soup
all over me nice suit,
我去喝汤
我全身上下都穿着漂亮的衣服，

01:33.612 --> 01:36.061
and our meal will be free.
而且我们的餐食是免费的。

01:37.405 --> 01:38.992
[grunts] <i>[drum roll]</i>
[咕噜声]<i>[鼓声]</i>

01:39.061 --> 01:41.681
- Whoa!
- Oh, no.
- 哇！
- 哦，不。

01:44.199 --> 01:47.750
[cheers and applause]
- Bravo!
[欢呼和掌声]
- 太棒了！

01:47.819 --> 01:50.164
I've got one last thing to try!
我还有最后一件事要尝试！

01:51.957 --> 01:55.474
Uh, waiter.
There's an eyelash in me soup.
呃，服务员。
我的汤里有一根睫毛。

01:55.543 --> 01:58.026
Oh, my dear.
How revolting.
哦，亲爱的。
多么令人反感啊。

02:01.095 --> 02:02.681
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:02.750 --> 02:05.923
- SpongeBob?
- Oh, bonjour, Mrs. Puff.
- 海绵宝宝？
- 噢，你好，帕芙女士。

02:05.992 --> 02:08.543
Mr. Krabs said if I came along,
we'd all get a free meal.
蟹老板说如果我一起去的话
我们都会得到一顿免费餐。

02:08.612 --> 02:12.785
Eugene!
This is so embarrassing.
尤金！
这太尴尬了。

02:12.854 --> 02:14.716
[nervous laugh]
Wait!
[紧张的笑声]
等等！

02:14.785 --> 02:18.130
[clears throat]
Your bill, sir.
[清嗓子]
你的账单，先生。

02:18.199 --> 02:20.405
Do you take Krusty Krab coupons?
你接受 Krusty Krab 优惠券吗？

02:20.474 --> 02:24.440
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

02:24.509 --> 02:26.371
Oh...
[grumbles]
哦...
[抱怨]

02:26.440 --> 02:28.819
Oh, no, don't go, sweetie bunch.
哦，不，别走，亲爱的。

02:28.888 --> 02:32.681
Your wittle Krabsy is so sowwy.
你那狡猾的克拉布西真是太可爱了。

02:32.750 --> 02:34.440
Once again,
再次，

02:34.509 --> 02:38.992
you've ruined our whole evening
by being cheap.
你毁了我们整个晚上
通过便宜。

02:39.061 --> 02:41.716
I thought you cared about me.
我以为你关心我。

02:41.785 --> 02:43.199
I do.
我愿意。

02:43.268 --> 02:45.681
I'll make it up to you,
honey biscuit.
我会补偿你的
蜂蜜饼干。

02:45.750 --> 02:48.819
Tomorrow night at my house,
we'll have the most romantical
明天晚上在我家，
我们将拥有最浪漫的

02:48.888 --> 02:51.233
and fancy-type meal
you ever tasted.
和精致的餐点
你尝过。

02:51.302 --> 02:55.750
All right,
but it had better be perfect...
好吧，
但最好是完美的...

02:55.819 --> 02:57.888
or else!
否则！

02:57.957 --> 02:59.647
[gulps]
[nervous laugh]
[吞咽]
[紧张的笑声]

02:59.716 --> 03:02.061
Mr. Krabs,
you forgot your soup.
蟹老板先生，
你忘记了你的汤。

03:07.199 --> 03:08.405
SpongeBob,
海绵宝宝，

03:08.474 --> 03:10.923
I got another little job for you
tomorrow night.
我为你准备了另一份小工作
明天晚上。

03:12.854 --> 03:15.992
[doorbell ringing]
[门铃响]

03:17.854 --> 03:20.233
I love working free overtime!
我喜欢免费加班！

03:20.302 --> 03:23.095
Like I love
the sweet embrace of death.
就像我爱的那样
死亡的甜蜜拥抱。

03:23.164 --> 03:25.509
Get inside, you two,
before Puff sees you.
你们两个进去吧
在泡芙见到你之前。

03:25.578 --> 03:26.785
- Whoa!
- [grunts]
- 哇！
- [咕哝]

03:26.854 --> 03:29.509
SpongeBob, you're cooking
a fancy-pants dinner
海绵宝宝，你做饭了
一顿华丽的晚餐

03:29.578 --> 03:30.992
for me and Mrs. Puff.
给我和帕夫太太。

03:31.061 --> 03:33.716
- - I came prepared, Mr. Krabs.
- Fwhoom!
- - 我是有备而来的，蟹老板。
- 嗬！

03:33.785 --> 03:36.371
Fancy pants for a fancy meal.
花哨的裤子适合一顿丰盛的大餐。

03:36.440 --> 03:37.854
[laughs]
[笑]

03:37.923 --> 03:41.130
SpongeBob can't cook anything
but grease trap muck.
海绵宝宝不会煮任何东西
但隔油池是淤泥。

03:41.199 --> 03:43.268
He's not a gourmet like moi.
他不像莫伊那样是个美食家。

03:43.337 --> 03:46.268
Not true, I can cook fancy food.
不是真的，我可以做美味的食物。

03:46.337 --> 03:51.164
I once made a Krabby Patty
with three buns.
我曾经做过蟹黄饼
三个面包。

03:51.233 --> 03:53.164
You make a good point, Squidward.
你说得很好，章鱼哥。

03:53.233 --> 03:55.244
That's why you're gonna use
your highfalutin knowledge
这就是为什么你要使用
你傲慢的知识

03:55.268 --> 03:57.509
to supervise him.
- Of course.
来监督他。
- 当然。

03:57.578 --> 04:00.268
[whistles]
Pearl, you're serving the food.
[口哨声]
珍珠，你正在上菜。

04:00.337 --> 04:04.612
But, Daddy, I was planning
on staring at my phone tonight!
但是，爸爸，我正计划着
今晚就盯着我的手机！

04:04.681 --> 04:06.302
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:06.371 --> 04:09.337
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:11.440 --> 04:13.268
This place is ancient.
这个地方很古老。

04:13.337 --> 04:16.888
How are we supposed to cook
anything with this junk?
我们应该怎样做饭
这个垃圾有什么吗？

04:16.957 --> 04:18.750
What are you talking about?
你在说什么？

04:18.819 --> 04:21.957
This is high-quality
navy surplus here.
这是高品质的
这里有海军剩余。

04:24.130 --> 04:25.474
[all gasp]
- Oh!
[全都喘气]
- 哦！

04:27.095 --> 04:28.371
[nervous laugh]
[紧张的笑声]

04:28.440 --> 04:30.543
So maybe it's a little outdated.
所以也许它有点过时了。

04:30.612 --> 04:32.095
Now just get cooking!
现在就去做饭吧！

04:32.164 --> 04:34.923
And the dinner had better
be fantastic, or else!
晚餐也更好吃
太棒了，否则！

04:34.992 --> 04:39.578
[doorbell rings]
Ooh, me lady fair is here.
[门铃响]
噢，我的淑女来了。

04:39.647 --> 04:40.992
Ooh, what's this do?
哦哦，这是做什么的？

04:41.061 --> 04:43.750
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:43.819 --> 04:45.681
[growls]
[咆哮]

04:45.750 --> 04:47.337
Good evening, me dear.
晚上好，亲爱的。

04:47.405 --> 04:51.026
May I say you look lovelier
than a stack o' twenties.
我可以说你看起来更可爱吗
比一堆二十多岁的人还要多。

04:51.095 --> 04:52.923
Oh, Eugene.
哦，尤金。

04:52.992 --> 04:56.440
You know how I love it when you
compare me to folding money.
你知道我有多喜欢你
将我比作叠钱。

04:56.509 --> 04:57.681
[chuckles]
[笑声]

04:57.750 --> 05:00.957
Me daughter Pearl
will be our server tonight.
我女儿珍珠
今晚将成为我们的服务员。

05:01.026 --> 05:03.026
[gasps]
How sweet.
[喘气]
多么甜蜜啊。

05:03.095 --> 05:04.854
Oh!
- [sighs]
哦！
- [叹气]

05:04.923 --> 05:08.026
<i>[mellow lounge music]</i>
<i>[柔和的休息室音乐]</i>

05:08.095 --> 05:10.371
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:10.440 --> 05:11.612
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:11.681 --> 05:14.337
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

05:16.923 --> 05:18.957
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

05:19.026 --> 05:20.233
[belches]
Oh!
[打嗝]
哦！

05:20.302 --> 05:23.095
The sparkling cider
is extra fizzy tonight.
闪闪发光的苹果酒
今晚特别热闹。

05:23.164 --> 05:24.819
Now you just relax, Puffkins,
现在你就放松吧，帕夫金斯，

05:24.888 --> 05:28.405
while I consult with me
very expensive private chefs.
当我与我协商时
非常昂贵的私人厨师。

05:28.474 --> 05:29.612
[chuckles]
[笑声]

05:29.681 --> 05:31.819
All right, hurry up,
you cheap slop slingers!
好吧，快点，
你们这些廉价的垃圾投掷者！

05:31.888 --> 05:33.785
Get the dinner on the table!
把晚饭端上桌吧！

05:33.854 --> 05:37.647
[groaning]
[呻吟]

05:37.716 --> 05:41.578
Here, even a simpleton like you
can make a salad.
在这里，即使是像你这样的傻瓜
可以做沙拉。

05:41.647 --> 05:45.612
And it better be fancy.
而且最好是别致的。

05:45.681 --> 05:48.026
Oh, I hope I can make it
fancy enough.
哦，我希望我能成功
够花哨的。

05:48.095 --> 05:50.578
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:55.233 --> 05:57.440
How's this? <i>[angelic choir sings]</i>
这怎么样？ <i>[天使合唱团唱歌]</i>

05:59.716 --> 06:01.543
- [groans]
- Oops!
- [呻吟]
- 哎呀！

06:01.612 --> 06:04.095
Can't forget the salad dressing.
不能忘记沙拉酱。

06:05.716 --> 06:09.268
- [groans]
- Ah!
- [呻吟]
- 啊！

06:09.337 --> 06:12.130
Mmm, it looks wonderful.
嗯，看起来棒极了。

06:12.199 --> 06:14.440
Huh, it kind of does,
doesn't it?
呵呵，有点像，
不是吗？

06:16.268 --> 06:18.302
Hey, not bad.
嘿，还不错。

06:19.750 --> 06:21.337
[belches]
[打嗝]

06:22.612 --> 06:24.612
But it's not good enough
for my puffy-kins!
但这还不够好
为了我的浮肿亲戚！

06:24.681 --> 06:27.543
[nervous laugh]
- Why, Eugene, how gallant!
[紧张的笑声]
- 哎呀，尤金，多么英勇啊！

06:27.612 --> 06:30.233
I'll just go check
on our next course.
我去检查一下
在我们的下一课程中。

06:30.302 --> 06:33.061
[rumbling]
Oh, my.
[隆隆声]
哦，我的。

06:36.405 --> 06:38.026
What in the name
of all that's greasy
名字里有什么
所有油腻的东西

06:38.095 --> 06:39.923
are you doing in here?
你在这儿做什么？

06:39.992 --> 06:42.509
Salads ain't supposed
to have bubbles.
沙拉不应该是
要有气泡。

06:42.578 --> 06:45.164
Squidward, you're supposed
to be watching him.
章鱼哥，你应该
监视他。

06:45.233 --> 06:48.716
Don't ruin this dinner for me.
别毁了我这顿晚餐。

06:49.474 --> 06:51.509
Just what did you put
on that salad?
只是你放了什么
那个沙拉？

06:51.578 --> 06:53.785
Oh, good grief,
this is dish soap!
哦，好悲伤，
这是洗碗皂！

06:53.854 --> 06:55.061
[sniffs]
I thought those salads
[嗅嗅]
我以为那些沙拉

06:55.130 --> 06:56.716
had a fresh lemony scent.
有新鲜的柠檬香味。

06:56.785 --> 06:59.199
Go back to cooking,
you numbskull.
回去做饭，
你这个笨蛋。

07:03.337 --> 07:06.026
- [nervous laugh]
- Oh!
- [紧张的笑声]
- 哦！

07:06.095 --> 07:07.647
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:09.957 --> 07:12.164
- Huh?
- Ahh... ah!
- 啊？
- 啊……啊！

07:12.233 --> 07:14.578
Not fancy enough for you.
[nervous laugh]
对你来说不够华丽。
[紧张的笑声]

07:17.785 --> 07:20.026
Oh.
哦。

07:20.095 --> 07:21.854
It looks beautiful!
看起来很漂亮！

07:21.923 --> 07:24.164
- - Huh?
- Uh-oh!
- - 啊？
- 呃哦！

07:26.474 --> 07:27.854
[booms]
[轰隆隆]

07:27.923 --> 07:30.543
Still not fancy enough for you.
对你来说仍然不够华丽。

07:33.647 --> 07:37.405
Uh, still not fancy enough
for me fancy lady!
呃，还是不够华丽
对于我来说，漂亮的女士！

07:37.474 --> 07:39.612
[growls]
It doesn't have to be perfect!
[咆哮]
它不一定是完美的！

07:39.681 --> 07:42.509
Just give me some food!
只要给我一些食物就可以了！

07:42.578 --> 07:46.268
Yeah, okay, I'll just go check
on the main course then.
是的，好的，我去检查一下
然后是主菜。

07:46.337 --> 07:48.440
[sighs]
Huh?
[叹气]
啊？

07:48.509 --> 07:49.785
Hmm.
唔。

07:52.578 --> 07:55.405
You two had better come up
with something tasty,
你们两个最好上来
和一些好吃的东西，

07:55.474 --> 07:58.164
or you're both double fired!
或者你们都是双重射击！

07:58.233 --> 08:01.026
So we're fired from being fired?
那么我们是因为被解雇而被解雇的吗？

08:01.095 --> 08:02.750
Does that mean we're hired?
这是否意味着我们被录用了？

08:02.819 --> 08:04.750
- Yes!
- [growls]
- 是的！
- [咆哮]

08:04.819 --> 08:06.578
Then you're triple fired!
那你就三连击了！

08:06.647 --> 08:07.785
No.
不。

08:07.854 --> 08:10.854
Just make something edible.
就做点能吃的东西吧。

08:10.923 --> 08:12.337
[sighs]
[叹气]

08:15.268 --> 08:17.923
[sniffs] Hey,
that actually smells tasty.
[嗅嗅] 嘿，
实际上闻起来很美味。

08:17.992 --> 08:19.888
Hooray!
万岁！

08:19.957 --> 08:22.371
[grunts][groans]
[咕哝][呻吟]

08:22.440 --> 08:25.302
[growls, grunts]
- [grunts]
[咆哮，咕哝]
- [咕哝]

08:25.371 --> 08:28.095
- Ah!
- [groans]
- 啊！
- [呻吟]

08:28.164 --> 08:30.750
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:30.819 --> 08:32.750
[gasps]
[grunts]
[喘气]
[咕哝]

08:32.819 --> 08:34.716
Food fight!
食物大战！

08:34.785 --> 08:37.785
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

08:37.854 --> 08:40.750
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

08:41.923 --> 08:45.095
Whoa!
哇！

08:45.164 --> 08:47.130
[yelping]
[尖叫]

08:47.199 --> 08:49.543
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:49.612 --> 08:51.509
Ah, SpongeBob!
啊，海绵宝宝！

08:53.164 --> 08:54.923
Oh, oh!
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!
哦，哦！
热，热，热，热，热！

08:54.992 --> 08:56.371
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:59.923 --> 09:03.130
[relieved sigh]
Whew... huh?
[松了口气]
呼……嗯？

09:03.199 --> 09:06.681
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

09:06.750 --> 09:07.957
[nervous chuckle]
[紧张的笑声]

09:08.026 --> 09:09.992
Just let me check
the quality, my dear.
让我检查一下
质量，亲爱的。

09:10.061 --> 09:13.233
- Let go of my grub, bub!
- Whoa!
- 放开我的食物，小伙子！
- 哇！

09:13.302 --> 09:15.199
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

09:15.268 --> 09:17.268
I'm famished!
我饿坏了！

09:17.337 --> 09:20.750
Psst, that's not food.
That's SpongeBob.
嘘，那不是食物。
那是海绵宝宝。

09:20.819 --> 09:22.164
Argh!
啊！

09:22.233 --> 09:25.026
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

09:25.095 --> 09:27.543
We've gotta stop her.[grunts]
我们必须阻止她。[咕哝]

09:27.612 --> 09:31.509
Where are you going
with my dinner?
你要去哪里
和我的晚餐一起吗？

09:31.578 --> 09:33.371
Squidward, go long![grunts]
章鱼哥，走远！[咕哝]

09:34.578 --> 09:36.785
- I don't want him!
- Gross!
- 我不要他！
- 总的！

09:37.992 --> 09:39.992
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

09:40.061 --> 09:42.474
[growls]
[roars]
[咆哮]
[怒吼]

09:42.543 --> 09:44.647
- [screams]
- [screams]
- [尖叫]
- [尖叫]

09:44.716 --> 09:45.716
[sighs]
[叹气]

09:45.785 --> 09:47.923
[both yell]
[两人大喊]

09:47.992 --> 09:50.888
[sighing]
[叹气]

09:50.957 --> 09:52.095
both: [yelp]
两者：[尖叫]

09:52.164 --> 09:53.647
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:53.716 --> 09:56.199
[hollers]
[喊叫]

09:56.268 --> 09:57.819
[gulps]
[belches]
[吞咽]
[打嗝]

09:57.888 --> 09:59.992
Ooh.
[slurps]
哦。
[啜饮]

10:00.061 --> 10:02.233
That was delicious.
那太好吃了。

10:02.302 --> 10:04.302
Uh, Puffykins.
呃，普菲金斯。

10:04.371 --> 10:06.405
I don't know how
to say this, but...
我不知道怎么办
要这么说，但是……

10:06.474 --> 10:08.337
[together]
You ate SpongeBob!
[一起]
你吃了海绵宝宝！

10:08.405 --> 10:09.888
<i>[laughs]</i>
<i>[笑]</i>

10:09.957 --> 10:11.612
Hey, a candle.
嘿，一根蜡烛。

10:11.681 --> 10:13.957
Oh, my...
哦，我的...

10:14.026 --> 10:18.130
I'm afraid you'll finally
have to pass SpongeBob.
恐怕你最终会
必须通过海绵宝宝。

10:18.199 --> 10:21.578
Oh, just take me to the doctor.
噢，带我去看医生吧。

10:23.957 --> 10:25.957
♪ Dinner is served ♪
♪ 晚餐已上桌 ♪

10:26.026 --> 10:27.681
<i>[angelic choir sings]</i>
<i>[天使合唱团唱歌]</i>

10:28.923 --> 10:31.405
Three buns.
三个馒头。

10:34.199 --> 10:35.992
[gulps]
It's perfect.
[吞咽]
太完美了。

10:36.061 --> 10:37.474
[both sigh]
[两人叹气]

10:37.543 --> 10:41.268
[stomach rumbles]
But I'm still hungry.
[肚子咕咕叫]
但我还是饿了。

10:41.337 --> 10:42.337
<i>[ding]</i>
<i>[叮]</i>

10:42.371 --> 10:45.371
[slurping]
Ahh.
[发出声音]
啊。

10:45.440 --> 10:47.957
[screams] <i>[tires squealing]</i>
[尖叫]<i>[轮胎尖叫]</i>

10:48.026 --> 10:50.061
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

10:50.130 --> 10:51.440
I just want a taste!
我只是想尝尝味道！

10:51.509 --> 10:52.957
<i>Bon appétit.</i>
<i>祝你胃口好。</i>

<i>祝你胃口好。</i>